/* eslint-disable */
const Q_R_ABERTAS_ATRASOS = [
  ["Parte II · Atrasos", "A-E3c", "<b>Ficha 1, Ex. 3 — Em pedaços.</b> A Alice envia ao Bob um vídeo de 700 MB. Entre os dois há 2 routers e todas as ligações têm 100 Mbps (<i>store-and-forward</i>: cada nó recebe o bloco todo antes de o reenviar).<br><br>O vídeo é dividido em pedaços de 1000 Bytes, e cada pedaço leva um cabeçalho (\"envelope\") de 20 Bytes. Quanto tempo demora a transferir o vídeo em pedaços, comparando com o envio do ficheiro inteiro (168 s)?", null, -1, "<div class=\"sol-title\">Resolução</div><div class=\"sol-aberta\"><p><strong>Significado de todas as variáveis e conceitos:</strong> * <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> (tamanho do vídeo)</strong>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>700</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> MB</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>700</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> Bytes</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">700\\text{ MB} = 700 \\times 10^6\\text{ Bytes}</annotation></semantics></math>. Em bits: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>700</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bits</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">700 \\times 10^6 \\times 8 = 5{,}6 \\times 10^9\\text{ bits}</annotation></semantics></math> <em>(1 Byte = 8 bits)</em>. * <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>R</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math> (capacidade / taxa de transmissão de cada ligação)</strong>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> Mbps</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bit/s</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bit/s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\text{ Mbps} = 100 \\times 10^6\\text{ bit/s} = 10^8\\text{ bit/s}</annotation></semantics></math>. * <strong>Topologia</strong>: Alice <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>→</mo><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\to</annotation></semantics></math> Router 1 <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>→</mo><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\to</annotation></semantics></math> Router 2 <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>→</mo><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\to</annotation></semantics></math> Bob (2 routers intermédios <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>⟹</mo><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\implies</annotation></semantics></math> <strong>3 ligações físicas em série</strong>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = 3</annotation></semantics></math> saltos). * <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{trans}</annotation></semantics></math> (atraso de transmissão)</strong>: tempo que um transmissor demora a injetar todos os bits de um bloco/pacote no cabo: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">bits</mtext><mi>/</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{trans} = \\text{bits} / R</annotation></semantics></math>. * <strong>Princípio de <em>Store-and-Forward</em> (armazenar e reenviar)</strong>: cada router tem de receber o bloco/pacote por completo antes de poder começar a retransmiti-lo para a ligação seguinte. * <strong>Princípio de <em>Pipelining</em> (segmentação)</strong>: ao dividir o ficheiro em milhares de pacotes pequenos, as 3 ligações trabalham em paralelo, reduzindo drasticamente o tempo total.</p>\n<p><strong>1. Sem divisão em pedaços (ficheiro inteiro com 1 envelope de 20 Bytes):</strong> * O ficheiro fica com <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bits</mtext></mrow><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bits</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>160</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bits</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5{,}6 \\times 10^9\\text{ bits} + (20 \\times 8\\text{ bits}) = 5{,}6 \\times 10^9 + 160\\text{ bits}</annotation></semantics></math>. * Tempo de transmissão numa ligação de 100 Mbps: <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>160</mn></mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>56</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{trans} = \\frac{5{,}6 \\times 10^9 + 160}{10^8} \\approx 56\\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math> * Com 3 ligações em série sem <em>pipelining</em> (cada nó recebe tudo antes de reenviar): <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>56</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏𝟔𝟖</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\"> 𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{total,inteiro} = 3 \\times 56\\text{ s} \\approx \\mathbf{168\\text{ s}}</annotation></semantics></math> <em>(O envelope único de 20 Bytes é completamente desprezável face aos 700 MB).</em></p>\n<p><strong>2. Com divisão em pedaços de 1000 Bytes de dados + 20 Bytes de envelope:</strong> * <strong>Número de pedaços (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math>)</strong>: <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>700</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> Bytes</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> Bytes/pedaço</mtext></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>700</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>000</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> pedaços</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\frac{700 \\times 10^6\\text{ Bytes}}{1000\\text{ Bytes/pedaço}} = 700\\,000\\text{ pedaços}</annotation></semantics></math> * <strong>Tamanho total de cada pedaço com envelope (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{pacote}</annotation></semantics></math>)</strong>: <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1020</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> Bytes</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1020</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8160</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bits</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{pacote} = 1000 + 20 = 1020\\text{ Bytes} = 1020 \\times 8 = 8160\\text{ bits}</annotation></semantics></math> * <strong>Atraso de transmissão de 1 pedaço (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{trans,pacote}</annotation></semantics></math>)</strong>: <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8160</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bits</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bit/s</mtext></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{trans,pacote} = \\frac{8160\\text{ bits}}{10^8\\text{ bit/s}} = 8{,}16 \\times 10^{-5}\\text{ s} = 81{,}6\\ \\mu\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math> * <strong>Tempo total com <em>pipelining</em> ao longo de 3 ligações (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>ç</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{total,pedaços}</annotation></semantics></math>)</strong>: * A Alice injeta os <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>700</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = 700\\,000</annotation></semantics></math> pedaços na 1.ª ligação consecutivamente: o último pedaço acaba de sair da Alice no instante <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times d_{trans,pacote}</annotation></semantics></math>. * Esse último pedaço ainda tem de ser retransmitido pelo Router 1 (2.ª ligação) e pelo Router 2 (3.ª ligação), demorando mais 2 transmissões (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times d_{trans,pacote}</annotation></semantics></math>). * Fórmula de <em>pipelining</em>: <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>700</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>002</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>700</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>002</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟓𝟕</mn><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">,</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏𝟐</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\"> 𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = (N + 3 - 1) \\times d_{trans,pacote} = 700\\,002 \\times 81{,}6\\ \\mu\\text{s} = 700\\,002 \\times 81{,}6 \\times 10^{-6}\\text{ s} \\approx \\mathbf{57{,}12\\text{ s}}</annotation></semantics></math></p>\n<p><strong>Comparação e Poupança:</strong> * <strong>Poupança brutal com segmentação</strong>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>168</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏𝟏𝟎</mn><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">,</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟗</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\"> 𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">168\\text{ s} - 57{,}12\\text{ s} \\approx \\mathbf{110{,}9\\text{ s}}</annotation></semantics></math> (a transferência fica quase 3 vezes mais rápida graças ao trabalho em paralelo das ligações!). * <strong>Custo do cabeçalho / envelope (soluções oficiais <code>solucoes_ficha_1.pdf</code>)</strong>: * Sem envelope (alínea b), demorava <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>56</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>00</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">56{,}00\\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math>. * Com o envelope de 20 Bytes por pacote (alínea c), demora <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>57</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">57{,}12\\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math>. * O acréscimo de tempo devido aos envelopes é de <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>57</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>56</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>00</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏</mn><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">,</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏𝟐</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\"> 𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">57{,}12 - 56{,}00 = \\mathbf{1{,}12\\text{ s}}</annotation></semantics></math> (exatamente a resposta do gabarito oficial). * Conclusão: o overhead do cabeçalho custa apenas cerca de 2% (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>/</mi><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20 / 1000</annotation></semantics></math>), compensando largamente o ganho do <em>pipelining</em>.</p>\n</div>", "<b>Para lembrar:</b> o cabeçalho também se transmite; pipelining poupa tempo.<br>Se a resolução não chegou, lê a teoria: <a class=\"teoria\" href=\"guia_redes_teste1.html#vários-pacotes-e-ligações-em-série\" target=\"_blank\">📖 Vários pacotes e ligações em\nsérie</a>"],
  ["Parte II · Atrasos", "A-E4d", "<b>Ficha 1, Ex. 4 — Store and forward.</b> <b>T1 —LAN— R —WAN— T2</b>, em fibra (2×10<sup>8</sup> m/s). LAN: 4 km, 10 Mb/s. WAN: 80 km, 1 Gb/s. Pacotes de 1250 Bytes de T1 para T2; filas vazias e sem outros fluxos.<br><br>Considera agora o caso inverso: LAN rápida a 1 Gb/s (propagação 20 µs) e WAN lenta a 10 Mb/s (propagação 400 µs). Quanto tempo demoram <b>10 pacotes</b> de 1250 Bytes de T1 a T2? (Atenção à formação de fila no router).", null, -1, "<div class=\"sol-title\">Resolução</div><div class=\"sol-aberta\"><p><strong>Significado de todas as variáveis e conceitos:</strong> * <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> (tamanho do pacote)</strong>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1250</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> Bytes</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1250</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bits</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>000</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bits</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bits</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1250\\text{ Bytes} = 1250 \\times 8\\text{ bits} = 10\\,000\\text{ bits} = 10^4\\text{ bits}</annotation></semantics></math>. * <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>v</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math> (velocidade de propagação da luz na fibra)</strong>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> m/s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 10^8\\text{ m/s}</annotation></semantics></math>. * <strong>Topologia</strong>: T1 <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>→</mo><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\to</annotation></semantics></math> LAN (comprimento <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{LAN}</annotation></semantics></math>, débito <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{LAN}</annotation></semantics></math>) <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>→</mo><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\to</annotation></semantics></math> Router R <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>→</mo><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\to</annotation></semantics></math> WAN (comprimento <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{WAN}</annotation></semantics></math>, débito <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{WAN}</annotation></semantics></math>) <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>→</mo><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\to</annotation></semantics></math> T2. * <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>/</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{trans} = L / R</annotation></semantics></math> (atraso de transmissão)</strong>: tempo gasto pela placa de rede a injetar todos os bits do pacote no cabo. * <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>/</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{prop} = d / v</annotation></semantics></math> (atraso de propagação)</strong>: tempo gasto pelo sinal de luz a viajar fisicamente pela fibra da origem ao destino. * <strong>Princípio de <em>Store-and-Forward</em></strong>: o router R tem de receber o pacote por completo antes de começar a transmiti-lo para a WAN.</p>\n<p>Invertendo as taxas de transmissão, a LAN passa a ser ultra-rápida e a WAN lenta: * <strong>LAN (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> Gbps</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> b/s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{LAN} = 1\\text{ Gbps} = 10^9\\text{ b/s}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> km</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4000</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> m</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{LAN} = 4\\text{ km} = 4000\\text{ m}</annotation></semantics></math>)</strong>: * <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bits</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> b/s</mtext></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏𝟎</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝝁</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{trans,LAN} = \\frac{10^4\\text{ bits}}{10^9\\text{ b/s}} = 10^{-5}\\text{ s} = \\mathbf{10\\ \\mu\\text{s}}</annotation></semantics></math> * <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4000</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> m</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> m/s</mtext></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟐𝟎</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝝁</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{prop,LAN} = \\frac{4000\\text{ m}}{2\\times 10^8\\text{ m/s}} = 2 \\times 10^{-5}\\text{ s} = \\mathbf{20\\ \\mu\\text{s}}</annotation></semantics></math> * <strong>WAN (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> Mbps</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> b/s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{WAN} = 10\\text{ Mbps} = 10^7\\text{ b/s}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> km</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>000</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> m</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{WAN} = 80\\text{ km} = 80\\,000\\text{ m}</annotation></semantics></math>)</strong>: * <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bits</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> b/s</mtext></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\"> 𝐦𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{trans,WAN} = \\frac{10^4\\text{ bits}}{10^7\\text{ b/s}} = 10^{-3}\\text{ s} = \\mathbf{1\\text{ ms}} = 1000\\ \\mu\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math> * <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>80</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>000</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> m</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> m/s</mtext></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟒𝟎𝟎</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝝁</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐬</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> ms</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{prop,WAN} = \\frac{80\\,000\\text{ m}}{2\\times 10^8\\text{ m/s}} = 4 \\times 10^{-4}\\text{ s} = \\mathbf{400\\ \\mu\\text{s}} = 0{,}4\\text{ ms}</annotation></semantics></math></p>\n<p><strong>Cálculo para 1 pacote de T1 a T2:</strong> Soma-se a transmissão e propagação nas duas ligações: <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1 = d_{trans,LAN} + d_{prop,LAN} + d_{trans,WAN} + d_{prop,WAN}</annotation></semantics></math> <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1000</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1430</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏</mn><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">,</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟒𝟑</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\"> 𝐦𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 10\\ \\mu\\text{s} + 20\\ \\mu\\text{s} + 1000\\ \\mu\\text{s} + 400\\ \\mu\\text{s} = 1430\\ \\mu\\text{s} = \\mathbf{1{,}43\\text{ ms}}</annotation></semantics></math></p>\n<p><strong>Cálculo para 10 pacotes de T1 a T2 (Atenção à Fila no Router!):</strong> * <strong>Porque se forma fila no router R?</strong> * A LAN despacha pacotes para R a cada <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\ \\mu\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math> (o 1.º chega aos <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\ \\mu\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math>, o 2.º aos <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\ \\mu\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math>, …, o 10.º aos <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120\\ \\mu\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math>). * Contudo, a WAN (o <strong>gargalo</strong>) demora <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000\\ \\mu\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> ms</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{ ms}</annotation></semantics></math>) a transmitir cada pacote! * Quando os pacotes 2 a 10 chegam ao router, a WAN ainda está ocupadíssima com o pacote 1. Por isso, os pacotes <strong>acumulam-se obrigatoriamente na fila de espera (<em>buffer</em>) do router</strong>! * <strong>Cronologia dos 10 pacotes (em microssegundos <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math>):</strong></p>\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 20%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 20%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 20%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 20%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 20%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">Pacote</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">Chega a R</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">Começa a sair de R para a WAN</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">Acaba de sair de R</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">Acaba de chegar a T2</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10 + 20 = 30</annotation></semantics></math></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">30 (WAN livre)</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1030</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30 + 1000 = 1030</annotation></semantics></math></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1030</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1430</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1030 + 400 = 1430</annotation></semantics></math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">2</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20 + 20 = 40</annotation></semantics></math></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">1030 (esperou na fila!)</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1030</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2030</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1030 + 1000 = 2030</annotation></semantics></math></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2030</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2430</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2030 + 400 = 2430</annotation></semantics></math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">3</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30 + 20 = 50</annotation></semantics></math></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">2030 (esperou na fila!)</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2030</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3030</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2030 + 1000 = 3030</annotation></semantics></math></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3030</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3430</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3030 + 400 = 3430</annotation></semantics></math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">…</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">…</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">…</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">…</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">…</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100 + 20 = 120</annotation></semantics></math></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">9030 (esperou na fila!)</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9030</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏𝟎</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟎𝟑𝟎</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9030 + 1000 = \\mathbf{10\\,030}</annotation></semantics></math></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>030</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏𝟎</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟒𝟑𝟎</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\,030 + 400 = \\mathbf{10\\,430}</annotation></semantics></math></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fórmula direta do tempo total:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>O tempo total é determinado pela ligação mais lenta (a WAN), que transmite os 10 pacotes consecutivamente (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10 \\times d_{trans,WAN}</annotation></semantics></math>), somado ao tempo que o 1.º pacote demorou a chegar a R e à propagação final até T2: <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{total} = (d_{trans,LAN} + d_{prop,LAN}) + 10 \\times d_{trans,WAN} + d_{prop,WAN}</annotation></semantics></math> <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏𝟎</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟒𝟑𝟎</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝝁</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\">𝐬</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏𝟎</mn><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">,</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟒𝟑</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\"> 𝐦𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= (10\\ \\mu\\text{s} + 20\\ \\mu\\text{s}) + (10 \\times 1000\\ \\mu\\text{s}) + 400\\ \\mu\\text{s} = 30 + 10\\,000 + 400 = \\mathbf{10\\,430\\ \\mu\\text{s}} = \\mathbf{10{,}43\\text{ ms}}</annotation></semantics></math></li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Conclusão física essencial:</strong> O tempo total (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>43</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> ms</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10{,}43\\text{ ms}</annotation></semantics></math>) é igual ao da alínea (c), porque a ligação mais lenta (10 Mbps) tem sempre de transmitir os 10 pacotes. A diferença vital é <strong>onde os pacotes esperam</strong>: * Na alínea (c), esperam em T1 antes de entrar na rede. * Na alínea (d), entram depressa na rede e acumulam-se no <strong>buffer do router</strong>. Se a fila for pequena, pode ocorrer <strong>perda de pacotes</strong> por descarte!</p>\n</div>", "<b>Para lembrar:</b> agora a lenta é a WAN: forma-se fila no router.<br>Se a resolução não chegou, lê a teoria: <a class=\"teoria\" href=\"guia_redes_teste1.html#vários-pacotes-e-ligações-em-série\" target=\"_blank\">📖 Vários pacotes e ligações em\nsérie</a>"],
  ["Parte II · Atrasos", "A-F23a", "<b>Ficha 2, Ex. 3 — Espere, mas não desespere.</b> Uma máquina de café demora 15 s a tirar um café.<br><br>(a) Se a máquina estiver livre e chegarem 10 pessoas ao mesmo tempo, quanto esperam em média até à sua vez? E no mínimo? E no máximo?", null, -1, "<div class=\"sol-title\">Resolução</div><div class=\"sol-aberta\"><p><strong>Analogia de Redes e Significado das Variáveis:</strong> * <strong>Máquina de café <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>⇔</mo><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iff</annotation></semantics></math> Interface de rede / Router</strong>: representa o transmissor que processa e transmite os dados com taxa de transmissão <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>R</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math>. * <strong>Tirar um café <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>⇔</mo><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iff</annotation></semantics></math> Atraso de transmissão (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{trans}</annotation></semantics></math>)</strong>: tempo que a ligação demora a injetar um pacote no cabo, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>/</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{trans} = L / R = 15\\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math> = tamanho do pacote em bits, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>R</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math> = capacidade em bit/s). * <strong>Fila de pessoas <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>⇔</mo><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iff</annotation></semantics></math> Fila de espera de pacotes (<em>Queueing Delay</em> <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{fila}</annotation></semantics></math>)</strong>: tempo que um pacote aguarda na memória (<em>buffer</em>) do router até chegar a sua vez de ser transmitido. * <strong>Chegada simultânea de 10 pessoas <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>⇔</mo><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iff</annotation></semantics></math> Rajada de pacotes (<em>Burst Arrival</em>)</strong>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = 10</annotation></semantics></math> pacotes que chegam no mesmo instante a um buffer inicialmente vazio.</p>\n<p><strong>1. Tempos de espera em fila individuais:</strong> Como o buffer obedece a uma política FIFO (<em>First-In, First-Out</em> / primeiro a chegar, primeiro a ser servido): * O 1.º pacote encontra a linha desocupada e é servido imediatamente: espera <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟎</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\"> 𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{fila}(1) = \\mathbf{0\\text{ s}}</annotation></semantics></math>. * O 2.º pacote espera que o 1.º termine: espera <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{fila}(2) = 15\\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math>. * O 3.º pacote espera que os 2 anteriores terminem: espera <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{fila}(3) = 2 \\times 15 = 30\\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math>. * Genericamente, o <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math>-ésimo pacote (onde <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\in \\{1, 2, \\dots, N\\}</annotation></semantics></math>) aguarda por <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n - 1)</annotation></semantics></math> transmissões anteriores: <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{fila}(n) = (n - 1) \\times d_{trans} = (n - 1) \\times \\frac{L}{R} = (n - 1) \\times 15\\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math></p>\n<p>Para o 10.º pacote (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 10</annotation></semantics></math>): <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏𝟑𝟓</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\"> 𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{fila}(10) = (10 - 1) \\times 15 = 9 \\times 15 = \\mathbf{135\\text{ s}}</annotation></semantics></math></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Tempo de espera mínimo em fila:</strong> <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟎</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\"> 𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{0\\text{ s}}</annotation></semantics></math> (a 1.ª pessoa/pacote).</li>\n<li><strong>Tempo de espera máximo em fila:</strong> <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏𝟑𝟓</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\"> 𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{135\\text{ s}}</annotation></semantics></math> (a 10.ª pessoa/pacote).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. Tempo médio de espera em fila (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d}_{fila}</annotation></semantics></math>):</strong> Fórmula analítica da média para uma rajada de <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math> pacotes: <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d}_{fila} = \\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{n=1}^{N} d_{fila}(n) = \\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{n=1}^{N} (n - 1) \\times d_{trans} = \\frac{d_{trans}}{N} \\times [0 + 1 + 2 + \\dots + (N - 1)]</annotation></semantics></math></p>\n<p>Usando a soma da progressão aritmética <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i=0}^{N-1} i = \\frac{(N-1)N}{2}</annotation></semantics></math>: <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d}_{fila} = \\frac{d_{trans}}{N} \\times \\frac{(N-1)N}{2} = \\frac{N - 1}{2} \\times d_{trans} = \\frac{N - 1}{2} \\times \\frac{L}{R}</annotation></semantics></math></p>\n<p>Substituindo <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = 10</annotation></semantics></math> e <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{trans} = 15\\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math>: <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟔𝟕</mn><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">,</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟓</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\"> 𝐬</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d}_{fila} = \\frac{10 - 1}{2} \\times 15\\text{ s} = \\frac{9}{2} \\times 15 = 4{,}5 \\times 15 = \\mathbf{67{,}5\\text{ s}}</annotation></semantics></math></p>\n<p><em>(Nota: se a pergunta se referir ao tempo total no sistema até ter o café pronto na mão, soma-se o tempo de transmissão de si próprio, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math>: tempo total mínimo = <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math>, máximo = <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150\\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math>, e média = <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>67</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>82</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">67{,}5 + 15 = 82{,}5\\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math>. Contudo, o atraso estrito de fila é <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>0</mn><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>135</mn><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">135</annotation></semantics></math> e <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>67</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">67{,}5\\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math>).</em></p>\n</div>", "<b>Para lembrar:</b> o n-ésimo espera (n−1)·L/R.<br>Se a resolução não chegou, lê a teoria: <a class=\"teoria\" href=\"guia_redes_teste1.html#intensidade-de-tráfego\" target=\"_blank\">📖 Intensidade de tráfego</a>"],
  ["Parte II · Atrasos", "A-F22c", "<b>Ficha 2, Ex. 2 — Multiplexagem estatística.</b> Ligação de 1 Mbps; cada utilizador transmite a 100 kbps, mas só 10% do tempo. Com comutação de pacotes, há 35 utilizadores.<br><br>(c) Qual é a probabilidade de exatamente k estarem a transmitir em simultâneo? Calcula para k = 3.", null, -1, "<div class=\"sol-title\">Resolução</div><div class=\"sol-aberta\"><p><strong>Significado de todas as variáveis e conceitos:</strong> * <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>R</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math> (capacidade total / largura de banda da ligação)</strong>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> Mbps</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> kbps</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bit/s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{ Mbps} = 1000\\text{ kbps} = 10^6\\text{ bit/s}</annotation></semantics></math>. * <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math> (taxa de transmissão de cada utilizador quando ativo)</strong>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> kbps</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> bit/s</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\text{ kbps} = 10^5\\text{ bit/s}</annotation></semantics></math>. * <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math> (probabilidade de um utilizador estar ativo a transmitir)</strong>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\% = 0{,}1</annotation></semantics></math>. * <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - p</annotation></semantics></math> (probabilidade de um utilizador estar inativo / silencioso)</strong>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi>%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\% = 0{,}9</annotation></semantics></math>. * <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math> (número total de utilizadores a partilhar a ligação)</strong>: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>35</mn><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35</annotation></semantics></math> utilizadores. * <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>X</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math> (variável aleatória)</strong>: número de utilizadores a transmitir em simultâneo num dado instante. Como os utilizadores agem de forma independente, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>X</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math> segue uma distribuição binomial: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">Bin</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>;</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X \\sim \\text{Bin}(N = 35;\\ p = 0{,}1)</annotation></semantics></math>. * <strong>Comutação de Circuitos vs Comutação de Pacotes com Multiplexagem Estatística:</strong> * Na comutação de circuitos (TDM/FDM com reserva estrita de largura de banda), a ligação só suportaria <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>/</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> kbps</mtext></mrow><mi>/</mi><mn>100</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> kbps</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R / r = 1000\\text{ kbps} / 100\\text{ kbps} = 10</annotation></semantics></math> utilizadores garantidos em simultâneo. * Na comutação de pacotes com <strong>multiplexagem estatística</strong>, podemos aceitar 35 utilizadores porque os utilizadores não transmitem em contínuo e raramente estão mais de 10 ativos ao mesmo tempo.</p>\n<p><strong>Fórmula da Distribuição Binomial:</strong> <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0\"><mi>N</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0\"><mn>35</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>35</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(X = k) = \\binom{N}{k}\\, p^k\\, (1-p)^{N-k} = \\binom{35}{k}\\, 0{,}1^k\\, 0{,}9^{35-k}</annotation></semantics></math></p>\n<p><strong>O que significa cada termo da fórmula:</strong> 1. <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0\"><mn>35</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>35</mn><mi>!</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>!</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mi>!</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{35}{k} = \\frac{35!}{k!(35-k)!}</annotation></semantics></math> (combinações de 35 a <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math>)</strong>: é o número de maneiras distintas de escolher <strong>quais</strong> <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math> utilizadores (de entre os 35 utilizadores possíveis) estão ativos a transmitir em simultâneo. 2. <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0{,}1^k</annotation></semantics></math></strong>: probabilidade de esses <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math> utilizadores específicos estarem <strong>todos ativos</strong> ao mesmo tempo (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0{,}1</annotation></semantics></math> multiplicado <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math> vezes). 3. <strong><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>35</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0{,}9^{35-k}</annotation></semantics></math></strong>: probabilidade dos restantes <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(35 - k)</annotation></semantics></math> utilizadores estarem <strong>todos inativos/silenciosos</strong> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0{,}9</annotation></semantics></math> multiplicado <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35-k</annotation></semantics></math> vezes).</p>\n<p><strong>Cálculo passo a passo para <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = 3</annotation></semantics></math> utilizadores:</strong></p>\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li><p><strong>Número de combinações:</strong> <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0\"><mn>35</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>35</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>33</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>39</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>270</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6545</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{35}{3} = \\frac{35 \\times 34 \\times 33}{3 \\times 2 \\times 1} = \\frac{39\\,270}{6} = 6545</annotation></semantics></math></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Probabilidade dos 3 estarem ativos:</strong> <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0{,}1^3 = 0{,}1 \\times 0{,}1 \\times 0{,}1 = 0{,}001</annotation></semantics></math></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Probabilidade dos restantes 32 estarem inativos:</strong> <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>35</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>9</mn><mn>32</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0343368</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0{,}9^{35 - 3} = 0{,}9^{32} \\approx 0{,}0343368</annotation></semantics></math></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Multiplicação das três parcelas:</strong> <math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6545</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>001</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0343368</mn><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟎</mn><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">,</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟐𝟐𝟒𝟕</mn></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟐𝟐</mn><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">,</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟓</mn><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">%</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(X = 3) = 6545 \\times 0{,}001 \\times 0{,}0343368 \\approx \\mathbf{0{,}2247} \\approx \\mathbf{22{,}5\\%}</annotation></semantics></math></p></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Interpretação:</strong> Existe cerca de <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">22{,}5\\%</annotation></semantics></math> de probabilidade de exatamente 3 utilizadores estarem a transmitir em simultâneo. Este é o valor mais provável de todos, porque o número médio esperado de utilizadores ativos é <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[X] = N \\times p = 35 \\times 0{,}1 = 3{,}5</annotation></semantics></math> utilizadores.</p>\n</div>", "<b>Para lembrar:</b> binomial: C(n,k)·p<sup>k</sup>·(1−p)<sup>n−k</sup>.<br>Se a resolução não chegou, lê a teoria: <a class=\"teoria\" href=\"guia_redes_teste1.html#núcleo-da-rede-core\" target=\"_blank\">📖 Núcleo da rede (core)</a>"],
];
